Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:37.38,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你还活着）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.14,0:00:46.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.19,0:00:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.11,0:00:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.58,0:01:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.24,0:01:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.02,0:02:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦还没回来 我得陪着玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn's still not back. I need to be there for Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.40,0:02:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了不 - 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I said no. - Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.63,0:02:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你之前弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you were wrong before.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.37,0:02:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方不大 可以保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place isn't too big to protect.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得留下防守\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you need to stay back and help protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.62,0:02:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大部分人都训练过了 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of us have been trained, you know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.62,0:02:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你担心袭击 你根本不会走\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you were worried about an attack, you wouldn't be leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道山顶寨有多远吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how far the Hilltop is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.94,0:02:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道可能发生什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.39,0:02:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,救世军就在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those Saviors are out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们对丹妮斯做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what they did to Denise,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.18,0:02:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想对玛姬和卡萝尔做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what they tried to do with Maggie and Carol,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.06,0:02:35.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有达里尔 罗西塔和尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}to Daryl, to Rosita, to Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能碰上这种事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not happening to you, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么变化吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any change?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.67,0:02:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的情况在恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.14,0:02:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,车子选得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good call on the transport.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她会更舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I figured she'd be more comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,也意味着能坐更多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It also means you got room for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在外面 所以我要跟你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out there, so I'm gonna be there with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.00,0:03:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,买一送一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Package deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.33,0:03:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是送的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.45,0:03:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想撞到他们 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to run into them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你希望他们会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hope they show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.23,0:03:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 重点是让玛姬看医生 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, this is about getting Maggie to a doctor, not about…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.92,0:03:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你的 我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you, I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.00,0:03:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊妮德 别 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enid, stop. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.60,0:03:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 路途遥远 而你刚…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's a long trip, and you're just getting over…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.81,0:03:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是表面擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a superficial graze,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.27,0:03:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋白质在结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}proteins are binding,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.06,0:03:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们得讨论弹药的生产\N{\fnArial\fs30}plus we need to discuss ammunition production.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.84,0:03:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,和制造 所以走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and manufacture, so let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.63,0:03:49.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经试过了 他得寸进尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already tried. Give him an inch, he's taking a mile.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.58,0:03:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只要求你给我点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only asking for 23, give or take,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.18,0:03:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据路线来定\N{\fnArial\fs30}depending on the route.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.95,0:03:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我能帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can be of some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是此时此刻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's the time and here's the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.50,0:03:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忽视我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't shine me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.12,0:04:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来做你的军师 我绝对会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be your anchorman. Yes, I damn will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么是这种表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.54,0:04:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你别怪罪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're not putting this on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.76,0:04:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你们指了明路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we showed your people the way forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.71,0:04:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你们定了规矩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gave you rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.55,0:04:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们违反了规矩就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You broke the rules, so folks had to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:31.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,开第一枪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one who fired the first shot,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.00,0:04:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吊死了他 以儆效尤\N{\fnArial\fs30}we strung him up to make an example of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.11,0:04:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情本可以就此平息\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've stopped there.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.25,0:04:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们还是不听\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you people still didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,想抵抗我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to fight us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.57,0:04:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以只能这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is how it has to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.68,0:04:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别拦我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.44,0:04:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.07,0:04:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,去橱柜里拿几把手枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just grab some pistols from the closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但得快点 马上就得出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But hurry. We've gotta go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.94,0:05:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.73,0:05:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.31,0:05:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要 求你了 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, please… Oh! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,别打了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't. Oh! Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.56,0:05:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.35,0:05:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Carl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.42,0:05:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是回不来了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens if you don't come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要怎样继续撑下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I supposed to live with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到底该怎么办啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.04,0:05:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何都要活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just survive somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.73,0:05:49.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做好保护这里的准备了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready to protect this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,而救世军清楚这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Saviors know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们才会抓尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they grabbed Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.94,0:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这事没有商量的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not up for discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.52,0:05:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你只能冲着我脸上来一拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're just gonna have to punch me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.14,0:06:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把我绑起来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tie me up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.58,0:06:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只有那样才能阻止我\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause that's what it's gonna take to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.88,0:06:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个岗哨24小时都有人轮班\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have 24-hour shifts set up on each of the watchtowers,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.78,0:06:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个站岗的人都全副武装 做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}each one of them fully supplied and ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.58,0:06:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一这里失守了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the case that we're incurred upon,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们安排好了司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have drivers assigned,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤离以及牵制计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}evacuation and distraction,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,集合点也商量好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the rendezvous we discussed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.39,0:06:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论出现什么紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the event of any emergency,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.00,0:06:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的首要任务都是保护朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}my first priority is Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.71,0:06:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会辜负你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not fail you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.15,0:06:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你放心让我负责亚历山大的守卫吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you comfortable leaving me in charge of Alexandria's defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.44,0:06:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如救世军真的攻过来了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the Saviors do show up…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.97,0:06:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.68,0:07:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想 假如尚有余地的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking, if it's not too late,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.43,0:07:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要不要试图和他们谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}should we try and make some kind of deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们等我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.53,0:07:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟他们好好谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a deal for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.02,0:08:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你别来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you not to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像我会听你的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm gonna start listening to you real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.26,0:08:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.27,0:08:57.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.38,0:09:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们准备拿你杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is us about to make an example out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:04.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,给谁看\N{\fnArial\fs30}To who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.01,0:09:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My people…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.68,0:09:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,图书馆里的所有人都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone at the library, they're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.48,0:10:04.69,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.88,0:10:39.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.08,0:10:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,山顶寨的医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor at the Hilltop,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会让你好转的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's gonna make things better.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.07,0:10:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.26,0:11:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所经历的一切 都是一起挺过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we've done, we've done together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.07,0:11:05.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一起来到这里 如今大家也都还在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got here together and we're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.80,0:11:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生了许多事 但我们总能解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have happened, but it's always worked out for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.15,0:11:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们一直同舟共济\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it's always been all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.14,0:11:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.58,0:11:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause as long as it's all of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.36,0:11:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能战胜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.64,0:11:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它很难搞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.16,0:11:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本打算去杀它 但流血太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going to, but I was too busy bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,按住伤口会好些 但还是需要缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pressure should help, but you need stitches,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要用抗生素才不会感染\N{\fnArial\fs30}antibiotics to make sure you don't get an infection.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.32,0:12:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上要天黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be dark in a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.77,0:12:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我四处检查一下 确保能安全过夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll walk the camp, make sure we're safe for the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.51,0:12:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天一亮我们就往回走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at dawn, we will head back,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,找人帮你缝针\N{\fnArial\fs30}get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.11,0:12:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.16,0:12:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.30,0:12:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:12:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.29,0:13:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,有敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enemy close.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.12,0:13:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要上吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.10,0:13:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.80,0:13:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人属于一个不听话的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's someone who was with a whole lot of someones who didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.79,0:13:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以谈交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.25,0:13:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这儿 就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.25,0:14:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 是可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, we can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把所有东西都交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give us all your stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.84,0:14:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能得杀你们一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll probably have to kill one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.30,0:14:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是规矩没办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's just the way it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.70,0:14:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但之后我们可以开始谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}but then we can start moving forward on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你们乖乖听话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.02,0:14:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的条件我们不接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}that deal's not gonna work for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.63,0:14:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我还打算让你们把东西都交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fact is, I was about to ask for all of your stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.48,0:14:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想杀你们中任何一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}only I'm thinking I don't have to kill any of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.27,0:14:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想再杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any more of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.24,0:15:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 必须按我说的办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, my deal is the only deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.04,0:15:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不讲价\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.43,0:15:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我和我的人这就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and my people are leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:19.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.96,0:15:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你们的目的地还不容易吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plenty of ways to get to where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.76,0:15:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让今天变成你的死期吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to make today your last day on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.23,0:15:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.77,0:15:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你提到了也好\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that is a good thing to bring up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.93,0:15:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一今天是你的死期呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's the last day on Earth for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.16,0:15:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所爱的人的死期\N{\fnArial\fs30}For someone you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.42,0:15:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,万一真是这样呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if that's true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.38,0:16:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你该对车上的人更好些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you should be extra nice to those people in that RV,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.04,0:16:02.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为谁知道呢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you never know…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.37,0:16:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,说没就没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.39,0:16:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对彼此好一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be kind to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.48,0:16:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你说的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you said…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,把今天当成最后一天来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}like it was your last day on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.10,0:16:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.01,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不留在家里守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you stay back and help guard the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.56,0:17:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.63,0:17:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你为什么来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.20,0:17:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗格朗路比较近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Logrun Road's a straight shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.15,0:17:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要能见度\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want visibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.80,0:18:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 希尔顿路符合条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, you got it on Shelton.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.41,0:18:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,高尔夫球场 乡村俱乐部 坡地地形\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golf course, country clubs, sloping terrain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会中埋伏 很远就能发现敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No bum rush from the bogeyman. We'd see them from a good piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样会多走三分之一的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a longer trip by a third,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.78,0:18:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是周围一览无余 比较安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'd get the scenic safety of clear-cut dingles and glens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.57,0:18:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being serious, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.22,0:18:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,比恶疾还真\N{\fnArial\fs30}As coronary thrombosis.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 选好路线了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got a route? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.14,0:18:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.61,0:18:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只我一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克也出来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick came looking, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.37,0:18:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔 还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, some of the others…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.04,0:18:58.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们原本也会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在知道你的事之前就出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were gone before they even knew about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.77,0:19:03.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.77,0:19:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回去时 他们也该回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back by the time we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.26,0:19:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许已经回去了 等消息呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably back already, wondering.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为我是在胡闹吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm being dramatic here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为你找到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think you could just come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,说让我回去 事情就解决了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me to come back and that's how it'll go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.15,0:19:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们 你的伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people, your people,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.15,0:19:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们很在意你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.34,0:19:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我知道 我也很在意他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know they do. And I care about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.03,0:19:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我才不能回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I can't be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你才必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you have to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really just not get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.66,0:19:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,在经历了这么多事之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After everything that's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.22,0:19:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有在意的人 就会想保护他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care about people, there are people to protect,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,为他们而杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are people that you will kill for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你不想杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you don't want to kill…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.60,0:20:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或不能再杀戮下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}or if you can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就必须离开他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you have to get away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.32,0:20:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,两者不可兼得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do not get both.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…you should know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.63,0:20:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 人才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, everything's about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.28,0:20:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了人的人生一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything in this life that's worth a damn,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.49,0:20:22.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我所知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's what I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你独自出走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And out here on your own…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.72,0:20:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不能那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.49,0:20:40.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不是你说了算 快走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your decision. Just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.03,0:20:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会离开你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.37,0:20:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.53,0:21:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有在意的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you care about anyone…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.66,0:21:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就有代价 摩根 你要付出代价的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a price, Morgan, and you're gonna pay it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.84,0:21:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我付过 今后付不起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have, and I can't anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.32,0:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think we could do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦和玛姬做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they did, Glenn and Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.88,0:22:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只想问问你能做到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just asking if you could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.96,0:22:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你在做那样的大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're doing something as big as that…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.75,0:22:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那就是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}if that's living.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.00,0:22:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.85,0:22:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.69,0:22:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.98,0:22:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.19,0:22:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,贱疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.33,0:23:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要抵抗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We making our stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.09,0:23:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 了结他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.22,0:23:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 现在不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.22,0:23:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是以逸待劳 早做好了准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been waiting. They're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一个人开车的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}With one of us behind the wheel,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.13,0:23:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是5对16\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's five on 16.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.84,0:23:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要按对我们有利的方法来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna play it our way, how we want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.81,0:23:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.69,0:23:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 慢点退\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.58,0:26:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.25,0:26:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.74,0:26:30.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡萝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.14,0:26:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.75,0:27:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有多少油\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we on gas?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.64,0:27:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.23,0:27:21.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走之前我还多装了几罐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pulled some more cans before we left.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.36,0:27:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那些不是第一次拦路的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those weren't the same men who blocked the road the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.69,0:27:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的装备 不同的战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same outfit, different soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.74,0:27:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们继续开 送她到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We keep driving, we get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定会到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.92,0:27:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算不得不灭掉他们所有人 也要送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we have to shove each and every one of them up their own asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.18,0:27:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能开过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能拿房车冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't risk the RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.54,0:28:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你坐在驾驶座上 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay behind the wheel, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.79,0:28:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来开路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll clear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它们这样手拉手要很多人才能完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting together a red rover like that takes people.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.77,0:28:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.86,0:28:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.05,0:28:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.12,0:28:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是米琼恩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Michonne's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.25,0:29:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是达里尔的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Daryl's.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.51,0:29:52.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,回房车 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back to the RV! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.11,0:30:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.61,0:30:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.35,0:30:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,车底盘可能中弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undercarriage could've caught a bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是变速器出问题了 也可能没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or could be transmission. It could be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.59,0:30:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们刚刚是朝我们的脚开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were firing at our feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.81,0:31:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们封住了路 但并没有想拦住我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They blocked the road, but they weren't trying to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.72,0:31:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们希望我们走这个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want us in this direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.80,0:31:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴顿路是向北的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barton Road takes us north,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.33,0:31:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们得知道我们想去北面\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they gotta know we wanna go north.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.85,0:31:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,走米多斯路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.91,0:31:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微偏东一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could take us east a piece,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.94,0:31:12.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以绕回到梅休路\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we can get back on track on Mayhew.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.87,0:31:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还剩下三分之一的油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're down to a third of a tank.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.76,0:31:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,到下一站我们可以加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could top off at the next stop,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.29,0:31:17.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但之后就没油了 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but no refills after that. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.11,0:31:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.52,0:31:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.56,0:31:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,调头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.54,0:31:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.02,0:32:46.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.23,0:33:42.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.88,0:34:16.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.22,0:34:33.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸变得越来越困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Each breath is getting harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.02,0:34:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我估计也快不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I probably don't have too many more in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.51,0:34:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要好好利用每一口呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm gonna make each one count.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.34,0:34:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, here's how it's gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.23,0:34:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你躺在那 我会看着你慢慢死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna lie there and I'm gonna watch you die slow,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.30,0:34:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像之前在公路上我的朋友们那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like my friends did back on that road.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.75,0:34:58.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like I'm gonna.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.31,0:35:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看谁会赢 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who wins, bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.94,0:35:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.92,0:35:13.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样开头不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a pretty good start, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.51,0:35:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we close?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.14,0:35:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 马上就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we're… we're getting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才 我听到了枪声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were there… I heard shots.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.14,0:35:51.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 是救世军 不过他们都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the Saviors, but they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.18,0:35:53.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.63,0:35:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你送到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.22,0:35:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.92,0:36:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.05,0:36:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The baby's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.51,0:36:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在还没到头 没有结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't it. This isn't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.31,0:36:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有很多日子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.62,0:36:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会好好活下去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's gonna be more.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.10,0:36:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in you, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.24,0:36:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么 贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got to smile about, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.10,0:36:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.27,0:36:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing wrong with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.74,0:36:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就要死了 所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna die, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.42,0:36:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会有任何毛病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing wrong with me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.12,0:37:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你苦受够了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you've suffered enough now?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.98,0:37:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 估计还没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, probably not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.29,0:37:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.15,0:37:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 就这么完事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.13,0:37:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你现在杀了我 不然我不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you kill me now, I'm not gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.81,0:37:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你快做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.90,0:37:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界不会做决定 只能你自己决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world doesn't decide! You decide!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.73,0:37:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能说走就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.25,0:37:50.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能得偿所愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.33,0:37:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.86,0:38:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.93,0:38:09.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能活着离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.46,0:38:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.10,0:38:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.80,0:38:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.39,0:38:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.29,0:38:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能让我好好死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you please just let me go?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.89,0:38:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不能死\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.89,0:38:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会熬过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna come back from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.57,0:39:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.90,0:39:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到你的马了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found your horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.31,0:39:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也找到我的朋友了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found my friend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.99,0:39:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.13,0:39:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就让我们来帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's get you some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.47,0:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些踪迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}These tracks…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.94,0:39:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明他们不光人多\N{\fnArial\fs30}they would indicate they not only have people,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.57,0:39:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有大型武器装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}but some big-ass toys and capabilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.49,0:39:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,表明我们陷在齐脖深的屎坑里\N{\fnArial\fs30}What it indicates is we are neck-deep up shit creek.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.72,0:40:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴还都大张着\N{\fnArial\fs30}with our mouths wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.82,0:40:11.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别开枪 - 我可以试着打断链子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't. - I can try and break the chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.73,0:40:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.98,0:40:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以试试 - 没用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can try. - It won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.71,0:40:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要保留子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we need the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.17,0:41:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有好好对待你的人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're treating your people good, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.77,0:41:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把今天当成最后一天来过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it was your last day on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.75,0:41:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是他们中某人的最后一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe one of theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.46,0:41:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.43,0:41:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里会很热的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna get hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.41,0:41:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,去你们的目的地吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go get where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.36,0:41:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.88,0:41:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.09,0:41:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's the play?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.40,0:42:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她需要医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.42,0:42:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,北边还有两条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two more routes north from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.24,0:42:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可能已经在路上等着我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably waiting for us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.32,0:42:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他们就是在我们的前面 或者后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, they're ahead of us, probably behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.80,0:42:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们其实并不是在等我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they're not waiting on us, per se,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.34,0:42:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在等这辆破车\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're waiting on this rust bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.61,0:42:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们并不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.75,0:42:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这辆破车里实时的人数\N{\fnArial\fs30}the moment-to-moment occupancy of said rust-bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.81,0:42:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且太阳马上下山了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the sun sets soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.09,0:42:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一桶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the last of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.76,0:42:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果路上遇到车 就吸出汽油\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you see a car, try to siphon the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.48,0:43:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 保持前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than that, you keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.01,0:43:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让他们以为我们在配合着玩他们的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have them thinking we're playing their game.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.29,0:43:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一关接着一关 一级接着一级\N{\fnArial\fs30}All phases of the turn, level after level,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.79,0:43:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一步接着一步 我会骗得他们团团转\N{\fnArial\fs30}move after move, I'll keep them spun.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.93,0:43:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向你保证 我会做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assure you, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.96,0:43:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有东西要给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.87,0:43:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个配方 不是西班牙冻汤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a recipe, and it ain't gazpacho.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.86,0:43:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,如何从零开始制造子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}How to Build Bullets 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.86,0:43:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伯拉罕可以带你去那个地方 以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abraham can show you where, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.17,0:43:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.12,0:43:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.49,0:43:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你在我们很幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're lucky you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.30,0:43:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就勉强同意你这话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't argue with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.20,0:43:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,踩油门稳一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go steady on the pedal.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.17,0:43:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开得太猛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't make that thing gulp.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.91,0:43:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么从来都没有让我开过卡车呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come you never let me drive the truck?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.40,0:44:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会开车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you could do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.49,0:44:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.02,0:44:15.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个生存者\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.55,0:44:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always were.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.70,0:44:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是以前不知道罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just didn't know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.82,0:44:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你都没意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.60,0:44:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.67,0:46:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚伦 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aaron, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.18,0:46:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我走路吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me walk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.14,0:46:20.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.04,0:46:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有几英里就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a few more miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.29,0:46:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见我们走的时候你和她说的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard what you told her when we were leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.49,0:46:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的确可以战胜一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.22,0:46:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们会做一切必要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause we'll do anything we need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.14,0:46:39.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是 以后也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have and we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.29,0:46:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹妮斯身上发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to Denise,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.30,0:46:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不允许再发生在任何人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let anybody die like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.45,0:46:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 儿子… - 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Son… - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.30,0:47:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.54,0:48:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.46,0:48:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.36,0:48:55.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到你们的目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to where you're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.17,0:49:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要收走你们的武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.52,0:49:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.46,0:49:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们可以谈… - 不用谈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can talk about… - We're done talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.11,0:49:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该听话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.29,0:49:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's yours, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.24,0:49:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.93,0:49:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.68,0:49:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,把她放下来 你们都跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get her down and get you all on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.35,0:49:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好多事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots to cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.99,0:50:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.74,0:50:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.83,0:50:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.45,0:50:42.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna need you on your knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.33,0:51:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,再带一个出来 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get you another one. Right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.26,0:51:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 德怀特 - 来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dwight! - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.23,0:51:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chop-chop.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.32,0:51:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.67,0:51:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你见见人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got people to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.76,0:52:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.44,0:52:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.85,0:52:16.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.69,0:52:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,都到齐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a full boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.27,0:52:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,见见我们头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's meet the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.96,0:52:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓尿裤子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pissing our pants yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.35,0:52:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好家伙 我觉得快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, do I have a feeling we're getting close.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.36,0:53:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.95,0:53:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就要屁滚尿流了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be pee-pee pants city here real soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.49,0:53:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些混蛋谁是头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of you pricks is the leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.96,0:53:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.46,0:53:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是头儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.14,0:53:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是瑞克 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're Rick, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.40,0:53:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是尼根\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Negan.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.07,0:53:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了我的手下 我可不太高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I do not appreciate you killing my men.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.80,0:53:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 我派人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, when I sent my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.73,0:53:44.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去替我的手下报仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}to kill your people for killing my people,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.76,0:53:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又杀了我更多手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you killed more of my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.01,0:53:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不厚道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.00,0:53:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不厚道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.67,0:53:57.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.34,0:53:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干的事儿有多不厚道\N{\fnArial\fs30}how not cool that shit is.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.47,0:54:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我想你马上就要知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think you're gonna be up to speed shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.27,0:54:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.55,0:54:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你马上就会很后悔跟我作对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so gonna regret crossing me in a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.95,0:54:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.36,0:54:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 无论你做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Rick, whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.40,0:54:24.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.72,0:54:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都不该挑战新世界的秩序\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't mess with the new world order.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.70,0:54:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你新世界的秩序是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the new world order is this,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.94,0:54:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常非常简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's really very simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.74,0:54:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以即便你蠢 你也很可能确实蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, even if you're stupid, which you very may well be,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.32,0:54:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也能懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.96,0:54:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.22,0:54:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了 注意听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here goes. Pay attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.09,0:54:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的东西给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your shit…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.09,0:54:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.63,0:55:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就像是自我介绍日啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today was career day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.06,0:55:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们投入了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We invested a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.26,0:55:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让你们知道我是谁 我能做出什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you would know who I am and what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.66,0:55:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们现在都要替我工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.45,0:55:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得到任何东西 都要上交给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have shit, you give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.66,0:55:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your job.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.42,0:55:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你们一时间很难接受这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know that is a mighty big, nasty pill to swallow,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.55,0:55:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们最终一定会接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but swallow it you most certainly will.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.06,0:55:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你称霸一方\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ruled the roost.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.03,0:55:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,建造了安全窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built something.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.78,0:55:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为自己很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You thought you were safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.12,0:55:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我理解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.15,0:55:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是世界已经失序\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the word is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.32,0:55:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们并不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.58,0:56:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点都不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.62,0:56:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上 你们已经完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you are pegged,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.17,0:56:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不照我说的做 就更完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}more pegged if you don't do what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.17,0:56:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要的 就是你们一半的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what I want is half your shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.89,0:56:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if that's too much,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.18,0:56:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可以制造 搜寻或盗窃更多的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can make, find, or steal more,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟早都得补上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it'll even out sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.70,0:56:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们现在的生存方式了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your way of life now.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.98,0:56:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们越反抗 就越艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}The more you fight back, the harder it will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.19,0:56:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 如果有人敲你家的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, if someone knocks on your door…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.36,0:56:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就得让我们进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you let us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.80,0:56:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,那扇门是属于我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We own that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.70,0:56:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如果敢阻止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You try to stop us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.00,0:56:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就把那扇门撞烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will knock it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.88,0:56:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,听明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.21,0:56:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 没有答复吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, no answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.55,0:57:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不会真的以为 你们不接受惩罚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think that you were gonna get through this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.72,0:57:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能逃过这一劫吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}without being punished, now, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.06,0:57:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并不想杀你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to kill you people.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.28,0:57:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想从一开始就说清楚这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just want to make that clear from the get-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.90,0:57:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们替我工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.24,0:57:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们死了 还怎么替我工作 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't do that if you're dead, now, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.41,0:57:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会去种菜园子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not growing a garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.33,0:57:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你们杀了我的人 杀了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you killed my people, a whole damn lot of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.22,0:57:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,多到我无法接受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than I'm comfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.17,0:57:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此 你们必须付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that, for that you're gonna pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.90,0:57:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.49,0:57:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打爆你们其中一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna beat the holy hell outta one of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.03,0:58:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.90,0:58:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,名叫露西尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is Lucille,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.08,0:58:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她非常厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}and she is awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.09,0:58:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这一切 只是为了从你们当中\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this, all this is just so we can pick out.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.94,0:58:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,挑出一个人来接受光荣的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}which one of you gets the honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.40,0:58:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可得把胡子好好刮一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh, I gotta shave this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.21,0:58:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走了我们的一把枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got one of our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.01,0:59:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走了我们的很多枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.68,0:59:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 孩子 放松一点嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit, kid, lighten up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.27,0:59:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少稍微哭一下嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least cry a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.84,0:59:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.21,0:59:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看上去糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look shitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.33,0:59:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就应该解脱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should just put you out of your misery right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.65,0:59:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.17,0:59:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.21,0:59:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God…!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.94,0:59:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.86,0:59:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 把他放回队伍中 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nope, get him back in line. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.44,0:59:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.58,0:59:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.08,1:00:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.33,1:00:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.50,1:00:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.22,1:00:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远不准再那样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't any of you do that again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.20,1:00:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会弄死你们 没有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will shut that shit down, no exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.81,1:00:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}First one's free.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.08,1:00:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们很紧张 我懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an emotional moment, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.25,1:00:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟透了 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sucks, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.78,1:00:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你意识到自己屁都不知道的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The moment you realize you don't know shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.56,1:01:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你儿子 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your kid, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.64,1:01:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这肯定是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is definitely your kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.72,1:01:19.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别这样了 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just stop this! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.14,1:01:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我杀了这个未来的连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not make me kill the little future serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.10,1:01:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给我动手的借口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make it easy on me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.23,1:01:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须选个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta pick somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.06,1:01:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个人都在餐桌上 供我享用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody's at the table waiting for me to order.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.61,1:01:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太难选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply cannot decide.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.16,1:02:05.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.45,1:02:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eenie…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.04,1:02:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}meenie…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.99,1:02:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,点\N{\fnArial\fs30}miney…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.18,1:02:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,将\N{\fnArial\fs30}mo…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.76,1:02:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}catch…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.72,1:02:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tiger…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.35,1:02:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,打\N{\fnArial\fs30}by…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.11,1:02:37.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}his toe.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.47,1:02:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,点到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.48,1:02:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hollers…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.73,1:02:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里就上\N{\fnArial\fs30}let him go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.45,1:02:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.62,1:02:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,破\N{\fnArial\fs30}told me…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.28,1:02:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pick.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.42,1:02:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,流\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.78,1:02:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}best one…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.55,1:02:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.12,1:03:02.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,场\N{\fnArial\fs30}are…
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.01,1:03:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.39,1:03:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人敢动或说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody moves, anybody says anything,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.52,1:03:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把那孩子的另一只眼睛挖出来喂他父亲吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut the boy's other eye out and feed it to his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.19,1:03:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll start.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.07,1:03:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can breathe,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.82,1:03:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can blink,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.58,1:03:25.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.52,1:03:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 你们每个人都会那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you're all gonna be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.11,1:03:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.03,1:03:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking it like a champ!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.44,1:03:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn!
